Crowning will increase your prayer timeout drastically, but you should
have enough potions of full healing, amulets of live saving and food to
render this irrelevant. You need not to actively strive for crowning, but
late in the game it is not a big problem anymore.

>Also is there anything I should watch for as I go down farther?

Have a good plan for coming back (Mark the VS before entering the
Wizard's tower, dig straight paths between the stairs in Gehennom.) and
make all preparations (Alchemy, scroll writing, stack management,
inventory clean-up) before killing Rodney for the first time.

